  "_readme": [
    "Pixel sprites for the Inferno map. Each sprite is 16x16; '.' is transparent; letters are palette colors.",
    "Ways to define a sprite: {grid:[16 rows]} | {person:{robe,shade,hair,skin,skinS,wing,mods:[...]}, post?} | {template:'quad'|'river'|'boat', colors:{...}, stamps?:[[row,[rows]]]}",
    "Person placeholders: H hair, X robe, x robe shade, s skin, S skin shade, W wings. Mods stamp onto the body ('.' keeps, '_' erases).",
    "post (optional): flipFire | flipV | crossRot | statueBands. Sprites are centered horizontally and get a 1px black outline automatically.",
    "Assign a sprite to a map point with its \"icon\" field in inferno.json. Unknown or missing icons fall back to kindDefaults."
